%% REST, no event bus: 6D §21.11). Dotted edges = asynchronous durable path (outbox -> relay -> Redis Streams -> consumer).
%% Package paths follow 3A §3 / 3B §3 under the D0 root package voice_agent/ (D0 README "Package root").
%% Sources: 2 §7.3-7.4; 3A §2-§3, §11; 3B §3, §8-§12; 6D §7.1, §10.4, §21; 6K §54; 7D; 7E §29.3; 7F; 7H §11, §17.2;
%%          7I §12.1, §16; 7L §23, §31, §34.5.
%% Revised 2026-10-16 for the first independent review: callback ingress/processing (P1-W0-01), capacity store in
