%% Revised a third time 2026-10-16 (third review P1-R3-01, M-R3-01): fenced recovery claim; FAILED input retention.
%% Revised a fourth time 2026-10-16 (fourth review P1-R4-01, M-R4-02): two-column discovery, tenant-scoped claim-or-recover, FAILED disposition only.
flowchart TB
