        CBP["callback processing worker + stale sweep<br/>tenant-scoped claim-or-recover (epoch, DB-time lease),<br/>decrypt outside transactions,<br/>PROCESSED/SKIPPED only with all owner effects,<br/>FAILED keeps input up to 7 days,<br/>no business effect on FAILED<br/>[BLOCKED: OD-W0-12, OD-W0-13]"]:::blocked
    end

